                  },
                  "answer": "The Program Toolkit and Activity Plans developed for the educational and outreach activities in partnership with Jamboree Housing (JH) will be uploaded to JH’s filesharing system for broad and free dissemination to their different centers and partners in California."
                }
              }
            }
