                  "meta": {
                    "schemaVersion": "1.0"
                  },
                  "answer": "All data will be stored in Dryad and will be available under a public domain, creative commons license (CC0). Note that while a personal ORCID is needed to deposit data in Dryad, no ORCID is required to search, find and download datasets."
